        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is shaped like a butterfly with a pair of blue wings. Each flutter leaves sparkling dust in the air. It absorbs life energy and is born from the wind, so it is a natural Gu. No recipe master has developed a refinement recipe for it.",
        "chapters": [
          308
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-origin",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It can be used on a race or group. An invisible force creates a habit or hobby that affects the whole group. Early uses include forcing steel needle boars to rub their skin on rocks so their needle fur wears down, and later uses against tribes and clans, such as removing a clan’s habit of brewing wine when food is scarce, or giving a rival clan’s women the interest to bind their feet. It is strong on a clan or force and has little use toward individuals.",
        "chapters": [
          308
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
